OL,7,     Fto Ireland to bury his father (his
OL,8,     F'Da'). While at his boyhood home,
OL,9,     Fhe encounters his father's spirit
OL,10,     Fand relives memories both pleasant
OL,11,     Fand not.
OL,12,G0035 The Next Best Thing
